The rows whose id begins with "T-" restate bounds and references from Terence Tao's table of optimization constants
(github.com/teorth/optimizationproblems), which is licensed under the Apache License 2.0; a copy of that licence is in
LICENSE-teorth-optimizationproblems. Please credit that table and the works it cites.
